# Animation Effect Templates
# These placeholders track the Effects/Animations folder structure
# Actual animation sprites are generated from Assets/Textures/Effects/Anim/*_sheet.png
# Run the animation setup from: PuzzleRivals -> Setup Verified Animation Sheets

# Expected animation files:
# - bomb_passage.effectanim
# - explosion.exphanim  
# - score_pop.effectanim
# - combo_counter.effectanim
# - player_eliminated.effectanim